<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Is This Yours? — AI text check</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Source+Serif+4:opsz,wght@8..60,400;8..60,600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet"
  />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">

    <div class="mark">Is This Yours?</div>

    <main class="sheet">
      <h1>Is this yours?</h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Paste a chapter below. We'll tell you which lines read like they
        weren't typed by a person — so you can fix them before an editor does.
      </p>

      <form id="checkForm">
        <label for="manuscript" class="visually-hidden">Your text</label>
        <textarea
          id="manuscript"
          name="manuscript"
          placeholder="Paste your chapter here…"
          spellcheck="false"
          required
        ></textarea>

        <div class="formRow">
          <span id="wordCount" class="wordCount">0 words</span>
          <button type="submit" id="checkBtn">Check the text</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <p id="errorMsg" class="errorMsg" hidden></p>

      <section id="results" class="results" hidden>
        <div class="verdict">
          <div id="stamp" class="stamp">checking</div>
          <div class="verdictNumbers">
            <div class="scoreLabel">likely AI-written</div>
            <div id="scoreValue" class="scoreValue">0%</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <h2>Your text, annotated</h2>
        <p class="annotatedHint">
          Shaded lines scored higher for AI patterns. Darker shading, higher
          confidence. Tap a line on mobile, or hover on desktop, for its
          individual score.
        </p>
        <div id="annotated" class="annotated"></div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      Powered by an open model (<code>chatgpt-detector-roberta</code>) via
      Hugging Face's free inference tier. Treat the score as a second
      opinion, not a verdict — these tools are wrong often enough that no
      score alone should decide anything.
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script src="/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
